{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新劇《夫妻的博弈》3日於翡翠台正式首播。劇中高海寧甫出場便經歷連串不幸，不但不幸確診患上胃癌，更親眼目睹最愛的丈夫與最信任的好姊妹偷食，隨後更慘遭推落馬路命懸一線。高海寧撕心裂肺的演出極具張力，開播即獲網民力讚演技大爆發，紛紛留言指被她的喊戲感動，直呼「高Ling演得好好，睇到好心痛！」</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇中姜幸如（高海寧飾）長期忍受丈夫施繼威 Mark（張頴康飾）的欺壓，在確診胃癌後的脆弱時刻，意外撞破丈夫與好姊妹潘雪文 Sherman（郭柏妍飾）在酒店偷食。面對丈夫與閨密的無恥嘴臉，更驚悉二人覬覦其巨額保險金，幸如當場崩潰，哭喊：「我唔明點解你要咁對我，點解係我最好嘅朋友同我最愛嘅人搞埋一齊㗎？」怎料 Sherman 竟厚顏無恥回應：「我只係好心幫你照顧阿Mark」，繼威更狠心掌摑幸如並咆哮：「你要死快啲去死」，幸如最後更被推向馬路慘遭車撞。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b4432982-627a-41d0-a4f1-5a86d993605c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20266X6HO18hj21785811534.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b4432982-627a-41d0-a4f1-5a86d993605c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6fbe2a34-cfb9-4bf3-b945-caa12cf3e325.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ud69Hi1iy21785811534.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6fbe2a34-cfb9-4bf3-b945-caa12cf3e325.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">高海寧受訪時坦言，今次拍攝過程極之痛苦，全因角色命運極其悲慘。談及與張頴康及郭柏妍的「捉姦」戲份，她直言拍完如同「無咗半條人命」，更需坐在地上平復情緒才能拍攝後續的掌摑戲。她透露，為了演繹極致的悲痛情緒，掌摑戲份更是「真打」上陣。她亦坦言在後期配音時心情仍難以抽離：「睇返片段，個心噏得好緊要，好似畀石頭壓住，簡直唞唔到氣。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"426dce7c-1d67-45dd-b0f4-cce540f873b3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026CYFSEdXJaw1785811534.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"426dce7c-1d67-45dd-b0f4-cce540f873b3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T05:19:14.524308+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":534,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}